WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:05.589
She's having the time of her life while lowering
her A1C, but the actress from the Jardiance

00:00:05.589 --> 00:00:09.210
commercial has a much bigger story to tell
about her life in showbiz.

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:15.490
One of the most ubiquitous commercials on
TV right now is for the prescription drug Jardiance.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:20.619
It's designed to help people with type 2 diabetes
keep their blood sugar levels under control,

00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:25.680
but you probably know it better for its elaborate
song-and-dance routine with an actress enthusiastically

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.560
extolling its virtues.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:31.580
The commercial has generated quite a bit of
buzz, especially among viewers who are curious

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.440
about who exactly its star performer is.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:38.450
Her name is Deanna Colón, and she's no stranger
to show business.

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:43.050
And this definitely isn't her first time on
TV, as she was a contestant on America's Got

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:45.184
Talent back in 2013.

00:00:45.184 --> 00:00:49.850
During her run on the competition show, Colón
blew the judges away when she auditioned with

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:54.171
a rendition of "And I Am Telling You I'm Not
Going" from the musical Dreamgirls.

00:00:54.171 --> 00:00:58.101
She ultimately made it to the quarter-semifinals
before being eliminated.

00:00:58.101 --> 00:01:00.180
But that was just the beginning of her career.

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:05.786
The same year that she appeared on AGT, she
also booked an extensive ad campaign for Big Lots.

00:01:05.786 --> 00:01:10.201
On top of all that, she's assembled numerous
soundtrack and music department credits on

00:01:10.201 --> 00:01:12.158
TV shows and films.

00:01:12.452 --> 00:01:16.340
"Since I was like seven or eight, I used to
be in my basement, singing along with Whitney

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:18.450
Houston and Mariah Carey records."

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:23.500
Deanna Colón actually got her start in showbiz
under the name Deanna DellaCioppa, which is

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.739
what she went by during her time on America's
Got Talent.

00:01:26.739 --> 00:01:31.490
She's been a prolific performer in commercials
for years, with many of them incorporating

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:33.388
music, as that is her specialty.

00:01:33.388 --> 00:01:38.430
And a look at her IMDb reveals many additional
credits behind the camera, as she's contributed

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:43.509
music to such shows as Sex and the City, The
Hills, and The League, just to name a few.

00:01:43.509 --> 00:01:48.490
Outside of commercials, Colón's acting credits
are much less numerous, with just one listed

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:55.021
on IMDb, as she appeared on a 2021 episode
of the TBS anthology comedy series Miracle Workers.

00:01:55.021 --> 00:01:58.860
With all the attention that her Jardiance
commercial has been getting, it's certainly

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:02.270
possible that we'll be seeing more of Colón
on our screens in the future.

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:07.850
And if her music work continues along at the
same pace, we could very well hear her, or

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:10.729
music composed by her, without even realizing
it.

00:02:10.729 --> 00:02:15.933
Based on this trajectory, it seems like Colon's
clout in the entertainment industry is only growing.

00:02:15.933 --> 00:02:19.870
On her Instagram, she recently confirmed that
she's the voice behind the song in one of

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:22.190
Instacart's most popular ads.

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:26.170
While she can't be seen in the commercial,
which has over 1 million views on YouTube,

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:29.550
we can hear her distinctive voice bring the
ad to life.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:34.460
We have a feeling that she'll eventually be
fondly remembered for more than just Jardiance.

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:39.220
In addition to working on some of the TV world's
most popular shows and commercials, Colón

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.978
also works as a vocal coach.

00:02:40.978 --> 00:02:47.010
And she boasts quite the prestigious background,
as she graduated from the iconic Berklee College of Music.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:50.989
She originally emerged from humble beginnings,
but her time at Berklee afforded her some

00:02:50.989 --> 00:02:52.940
significant opportunities.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:58.120
As she revealed in a 2020 interview with VoyageLA,
during her time at Berklee, she won her first

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:03.930
national singing jingles and also sang for
iconic musicians like Diana Ross and Patti LaBelle.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:07.750
Colón had to break some barriers to become
successful, and now she's at a point in her

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.690
career where she can say that she's quite
proud of herself.

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.651
As she declared to VoyageLA,

00:03:12.651 --> 00:03:15.735
"I truly feel there is nothing I can not do."

00:03:15.735 --> 00:03:20.220
Colón's story is the kind that shows just
what you can accomplish with enough hard work.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:24.480
In addition to all of her acting and singing
work, she's also a popular creator on social

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:28.466
media, as she boasts nearly 300,000 followers
on TikTok.

